  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fc23288b6d93aab489cf401afc66c4b7, type: 3}
  m_Name: FifthNPC_Quest1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  initialDialog:
  - The best thing about this island is those apples. They are so delicious! Oh,
    hi, by the way! I'm Michelle. Pleased to meet you!
  - I wish I could share my apples with you but I've just gone out of stock. And
    I've got some tasks to do. But if you're free, you could gather some apples for
    both of us. I'd promise I'd share but I'm too tempted by their redness...
  - There's lots of apples in the woods, gather 15 Apples for me and I'll give you
    some. Maybe.
  acceptOption: Okay, I'll be on it.
  acceptAnswer: Thanks! I'm dreaming of those sweets of deliciousness.
  declineOption: I'll reconsider when I'm free, Apple Lady.
  declineAnswer: Apple-Lady, huh? Well, that couldn't be more true. Let me know when
    you find the time.
  comebackAfterDecline: Apple-Lady to Major Tom. Have you finally decided to start
    on your Apple Career?
  comebackInProgress: The apples are surprisingly abundant in this island, I wonder
    who planted them here. But I'm glad they did, and I believe you will find the
    rest in no time.
  comebackCompleted: See! I told you they're delicious. You're the best of best!
    Okay, here's as promised, some apples.
  finalWords: Oh, by the way, I saw something shining near to the closed cave entrance
    while collecting apples in the woods. But I'm too scared to approach there, it's
    scary. What if there's a ghost or something? Ghosts, stay away from my apples!!!
  rewardItem1: Apple
  rewardItem1Amount: 4
  rewardItem2: 
  firstRequirementItem: Apple
  firstRequirementAmount: 15
  secondRequirementItem: 
  secondRequirementAmount: 0
